{"headword":"נוּס","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> flee, escape <strong>(</strong>Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܳܣ</span> <em>tremble</em> (rare), cf. Brock; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نوس</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">نَاسَ</span> <em>move to and fro, be in commotion, dangle</em>, Lane <sup>2866</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָס</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:25\" href=\"/Numbers.35.25\">Nu 35:25</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַ֫סְתָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.3\">2 K 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַ֫סְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.16\">1 S 4:16</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָנוּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:13\" href=\"/Exodus.21.13\">Ex 21:13</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּנָ֫ס</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:12\" href=\"/Genesis.39.12\">Gn 39:12</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְנוּס֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:7\" href=\"/Psalms.104.7\">ψ 104:7</a>, etc.; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֻ֫סוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.6\">Je 48:6</a> + 4 times Je Zc; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹס</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.3\">2 S 18:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָנוּס (לָנֻס)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:20\" href=\"/Genesis.19.20\">Gn 19:20</a> +; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָס</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:1\" href=\"/Amos.9.1\">Am 9:1</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָסִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:27\" href=\"/Exodus.14.27\">Ex 14:27</a> +; —"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>flee</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:12\" href=\"/Genesis.39.12\">Gn 39:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:15\" href=\"/Genesis.39.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:34\" href=\"/Numbers.16.34\">Nu 16:34</a> (all J); <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:16\" href=\"/Joshua.10.16\">Jos 10:16</a> (JE); <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.17\">Lv 26:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:3